helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id090920081050299				0	de	Schrägstrich /				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502913				0	de	Fragezeichen ?				20130618 17:22:18
