helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3109813				0	de	\<bookmark_value\>LOG (Funktion)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Logarithmen\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
