helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3109841	312			0	de	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_LOG\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Berechnet den Logarithmus zu einer angegebenen Basis.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144719	313			0	de	Syntax				20130618 17:22:18
