helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eastersunday.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152960	175			0	de	\<variable id=\"eastersunday\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_eastersunday.xhp\"\>OSTERSONNTAG\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
