helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\contextmenu.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153394				0	de	\<bookmark_value\>Kontextmenüs\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Menüs;Kontextmenüs aktivieren\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Öffnen; Kontextmenüs\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Aktivieren;Kontextmenüs\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
