helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170801.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346	7			0	de	Tabelle				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170801.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774	8			0	de	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_LISTBOX_RID_PAGE_TABLESELECTION_LB_TABLE\"\>Gibt die gewünschte Tabelle an.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170802.xhp	0	help	tit				0	de	Tabellenelement-Assistent: Feldauswahl				20130618 17:22:18
